{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35709","headline":"煌煌京洛行 · 李咸用","name":"煌煌京洛行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安近甸巡游遍，洛阳寻有黄龙见。\n千乘万骑如雷转，差差清跸祥云卷。\n百司旧分当玉殿，太平官属无遗彦。\n歌钟沸激香尘散，晨旗隐隐罗轩冕。\n周公旧迹生红藓，瀍涧波光春照晚。\n但听嵩山万岁声，将军旗鼓何时偃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35709.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35709","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}